---
// /newsroom/ — from the FINAL V Newsroom boards (Newsroom-Desktop, Newsroom-Mobile). The split
// title, the promoted articles (`promoted` 1–3; else the newest) as the featured card and the
// two beside it, then every story under type filters: articles from the news collection
// (src/content/news/), our YouTube videos, the gated resources (HubSpot landing pages) and the
// press coverage below. The boards' placeholder cards (a generic resource, a press release) and
// their cards for posts that don't exist are not built (tasks/todo.md); a filter shows only when
// its type has stories.
